Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 12:59:10 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] 3068: kern.sweet_ssc, the Mi 8 sensor DSP (SLPI): 1 read-only
 probe (slpi_dp firmware, carve-out, SMEM host 3), 2 boot (QMP, lcx/lmx, SMP2P
 430/481, PAS 12)

---
 bsd/conf/files           |   1 +
